{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "main_3_level_main_03-01_beg",
  "groupId": "main_3",
  "stageId": "main_03-01",
  "title": "會合",
  "storyCode": "3-1",
  "avgTag": "行動前",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_03-01_beg.txt",
  "sourceHash": "10fa6bf183ea108d0d53f9e538fe393fb22013a160fe7276b94f7c695306553c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十三关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "看來你們也不怎麼好過。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官，究竟發生了什麼事？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "整合運動的埋伏。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "沒有增援，火力猛烈，近衛局的隊形很快被他們衝散了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "那米莎......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "被一個紅衣服的女人劫走了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我真該——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "沒什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "陳長官，米莎身上究竟有什麼?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "再繼續隱瞞下去，羅德島與近衛局的合作進程只會越來越艱難。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我沒有告知你的義務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "但羅德島有瞭解目標並做出應對策略的義務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "羅德島在行動中會聽從近衛局的指揮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "不過，即便是用感染者去對抗感染者，我們也是需要情報的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "近衛局擁有資訊，卻不懂得如何對抗感染者才能減少損失。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "羅德島有對抗感染者的能力，卻不知道整合運動想要什麼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "你剛才說的話，有點那個醫生的味道。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "是，是嘛......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "我想......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1#7",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這是因為，這對於我們雙方來說都很重要。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "如果要請示魏先生的話——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "我們調查了米莎相關的情報，有一條情報指出，她的父親是切爾諾伯格的要人之一。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "米莎的父親？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "當然，我們也不知道，米莎究竟握有多少切爾諾伯格的資料。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "可能是零，也可能是一百。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "誰都不會知道有多少——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——除了米莎本人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "而那些切爾諾伯格的資訊，究竟含括哪些內容，我們也不清楚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "既然你們推測整合運動的下一個目標是龍門——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "那麼，阻止整合運動對切爾諾伯格的利用是理所應當的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "所以，我們並不想讓整合運動得到這名感染者，米莎。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "包括“有這樣一個感染者隨著逃難的人群進入了龍門”這條情報在內——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "在你發現米莎之前，我也並不能確定這幾條情報的真實性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "這樣的話，就不能再拖了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "必須在整合運動回到切爾諾伯格前阻止他們，救回米莎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "羅德島，立刻進行整備！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "追緝這名感染者，是我們近衛局的任務。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——同時，讓她落入整合運動之手，也是我們的失職。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "比起共同追緝，我們需要羅德島清除整合運動的其他威脅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "這是命令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米婭",
      "speakerToken": "char_002_amiya_1",
      "operatorId": "char_002_amiya",
      "portraitKey": "char_002_amiya",
      "text": "——我明白了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "交給你了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "不，不要！別，別打我......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "進入龍門之前難道沒想過自己的下場嗎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "啊呀呀！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "全都關起來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不是這批感染者。該死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "不是這批。該死......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "他們......撤退的太快了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "看來整合運動也是分層次的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "留下來殿後的這些，都是些用來拖延時間的渣滓。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "一個人拖住整個增援部隊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "難道會是......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "長官！那邊還有殘存的整合運動成員！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "跟我來！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "——！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "陳長官，小心！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "有埋伏！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "去，去死吧！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "別惹惱我————！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "陳長官，我們還在龍門城範圍內！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "周圍的設施可能還有它用，請不要過度破壞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#2",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "要你說！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近衛局隊員",
      "speakerToken": "char_015_lmg",
      "operatorId": "char_015_lmg",
      "portraitKey": "char_015_lmg",
      "text": "至少別再把那些房間切成塊了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "可，可惡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合運動成員",
      "speakerToken": "char_1002_nsabr_2",
      "operatorId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "portraitKey": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "text": "這個女人，很難辦！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "——難辦？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "愚蠢的感染者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
      "text": "————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "陳",
      "speakerToken": "char_010_chen_1#4",
      "operatorId": "char_010_chen",
      "portraitKey": "char_010_chen",
